WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.900
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.170 --> 00:29.330
[Live Forever]

3
00:30.530 --> 00:32.920
[Episode 10]

4
00:36.540 --> 00:39.430
Eloping sounds like a TV plot,

5
00:39.560 --> 00:40.920
but back then,

6
00:41.150 --> 00:43.030
we really weren't afraid of anything, not even death.

7
00:43.030 --> 00:44.110
I see.

8
00:45.670 --> 00:46.790
I see.

9
00:53.600 --> 00:55.250
Dr... Dr. Xie.

10
00:58.070 --> 00:59.030
Are you okay?

11
01:01.640 --> 01:02.520
I'm sorry.

12
01:03.280 --> 01:04.879
I lost my composure just now.

13
01:05.200 --> 01:07.510
I was moved by your story.

14
01:08.400 --> 01:09.430
Let's continue.

15
01:10.870 --> 01:11.510
So,

16
01:12.150 --> 01:13.789
that memory just now

17
01:13.789 --> 01:15.920
was when you loved each other the most.

18
01:29.039 --> 01:29.870
I suppose so.

19
01:37.350 --> 01:39.150
Let's go back to the beginning.

20
01:39.640 --> 01:41.590
Your initial question was

21
01:42.150 --> 01:45.210
how to make the other person fall in love with you again.

22
01:45.710 --> 01:47.440
After awakening the memories,

23
01:47.590 --> 01:50.000
we need to find your core conflict.

24
01:50.509 --> 01:52.680
The one who created the problem must be the one to solve it.

25
01:52.680 --> 01:53.950
I just don't know

26
01:54.590 --> 01:57.680
what your biggest unresolved issue is.

27
02:28.280 --> 02:29.210
You can't sleep?

28
02:30.079 --> 02:31.200
No, I fell asleep.

29
02:32.120 --> 02:32.710
I'll go

30
02:33.280 --> 02:35.470
see if Yu Tu is asleep.

31
02:36.850 --> 02:37.940
She wants a drink.

32
02:40.870 --> 02:41.870
You can't sleep?

33
02:46.590 --> 02:47.560
Yes.

34
02:48.400 --> 02:49.240
Have a drink?

35
03:02.680 --> 03:03.840
I'm sorry.

36
03:03.840 --> 03:05.400
I sprayed it on you again.

37
03:07.850 --> 03:09.340
I know you too well.

38
03:18.800 --> 03:21.200
-Why can't you sleep? -Why can't you sleep?

39
03:25.800 --> 03:26.870
My mind is a mess.

40
03:44.010 --> 03:45.329
I wish you hadn't

41
03:46.170 --> 03:47.400
saved me back then.

42
03:52.560 --> 03:53.490
In Southern Qin,

43
03:54.790 --> 03:56.420
if you hadn't meddled

44
03:57.150 --> 03:58.190
and just left me in that courtyard...

45
03:58.190 --> 03:59.750
So what if I meddled?

46
04:00.300 --> 04:01.760
I would have saved anyone.

47
04:09.620 --> 04:11.020
But if I had to do it again,

48
04:15.000 --> 04:17.000
I wouldn't want it to be anyone else.

49
04:33.240 --> 04:34.159
Ning Changyue.

50
04:42.190 --> 04:43.120
Do you dare

51
04:49.310 --> 04:52.120
to go out and buy me some osmanthus cake?

52
04:54.800 --> 04:55.600
Just that?

53
04:55.920 --> 04:57.870
I thought you were going to ask for the moon.

54
04:57.870 --> 04:58.530
Wait for me.

55
05:07.270 --> 05:09.070
Then do you dare

56
05:11.360 --> 05:13.120
to sell all the things

57
05:13.600 --> 05:14.750
you've collected?

58
05:32.190 --> 05:32.680
Hello,

59
05:32.950 --> 05:33.600
Wu Ya.

60
05:34.070 --> 05:34.630
Uncle.

61
05:34.710 --> 05:35.970
Sell all the things ...

62
05:38.830 --> 05:39.310
Hello?

63
05:39.800 --> 05:40.430
What's up?

64
05:42.270 --> 05:42.870
Uncle?

65
05:45.150 --> 05:45.950
Nothing.

66
05:46.409 --> 05:48.490
You know the little cat we keep at home

67
05:48.510 --> 05:49.750
is very naughty.

68
05:50.300 --> 05:52.360
She accidentally pressed the phone.

69
05:53.830 --> 05:54.690
I'm hanging up.

70
05:57.040 --> 05:57.630
Do we

71
05:58.159 --> 05:59.159
have a cat at home?

72
06:01.120 --> 06:02.250
Any other requests,

73
06:02.550 --> 06:03.550
Your Highness?

74
06:17.600 --> 06:18.460
Ning Changyue.

75
06:28.720 --> 06:31.120
Do you dare to jump off a cliff with me again?

76
06:34.100 --> 06:39.400
♪ My heart aches as if it's tearing through my chest ♪

77
06:39.430 --> 06:44.010
♪ Shattered into pieces ♪

78
06:45.180 --> 06:50.020
♪ Until my lungs have nothing left ♪

79
06:51.970 --> 06:57.420
♪ I'll kill the beauty that kept me awake ♪

80
06:54.720 --> 06:55.750
Are you ready?

81
06:58.060 --> 07:02.800
♪ I'll kill the beauty that kept me awake ♪

82
06:59.630 --> 07:00.800
From now on,

83
07:01.270 --> 07:02.820
whether in heaven or on earth,

84
07:02.820 --> 07:09.830
♪ I'll kill the beauty that kept me awake ♪

85
07:03.270 --> 07:04.390
you and I

86
07:05.070 --> 07:06.200
will never be apart.

87
07:12.560 --> 07:13.750
We are still alive.

88
07:14.630 --> 07:16.630
My leg feels like it's broken.

89
07:17.560 --> 07:19.720
Is it because of that pill?

90
07:23.560 --> 07:24.920
Hey, Song Yiqiu.

91
07:25.120 --> 07:26.380
Are you busy right now?

92
07:26.920 --> 07:28.850
Why didn't you come looking for me?

93
07:29.360 --> 07:32.430
I've waited for you for 72 years and 37 days.

94
07:32.430 --> 07:34.040
Wait for me. Don't rush.

95
07:34.040 --> 07:36.430
Why didn't you come looking for me?

96
07:38.040 --> 07:39.240
I really can't die.

97
07:39.240 --> 07:40.430
Try stabbing me.

98
07:43.510 --> 07:45.190
It hurts!

99
07:50.430 --> 07:52.270
What did you mean by raising a cat just now?

100
07:52.270 --> 07:53.070
Why bother getting a cat?

101
07:53.070 --> 07:54.120
They might as well raise me.

102
07:54.120 --> 07:54.920
Go away.

103
07:57.720 --> 07:59.310
We are not monsters.

104
07:59.720 --> 08:00.270
Go away.

105
08:01.240 --> 08:01.800
Go away.

106
08:02.630 --> 08:03.510
Go away!

107
08:04.360 --> 08:06.600
Oh my God.

108
08:07.500 --> 08:08.630
Go away.

109
08:16.120 --> 08:17.120
Song Yiqiu.

110
08:20.270 --> 08:22.430
Can I come to see you?

111
08:41.770 --> 08:42.750
Am I crazy?

112
08:43.280 --> 08:44.480
Do I have a death wish?

113
08:50.870 --> 08:52.730
How am I supposed to explain this?

114
09:06.750 --> 09:07.880
There's still time.

115
09:08.480 --> 09:09.270
Do it now.

116
09:55.900 --> 09:57.500
Let's take care of business.

117
10:23.220 --> 10:24.280
What are you doing?

118
10:32.790 --> 10:33.840
It's not working.

119
10:55.470 --> 10:56.080
Freeze!

120
11:03.200 --> 11:04.670
Look at you.

121
11:04.670 --> 11:06.630
Be careful with my sapling.

122
11:07.200 --> 11:08.080
Okay.

123
11:09.670 --> 11:10.720
I have to say,

124
11:12.110 --> 11:14.940
your trick is quite practical.

125
11:14.960 --> 11:16.130
Of course.

126
11:16.320 --> 11:17.440
I can stop time,

127
11:17.440 --> 11:18.750
control people's minds,

128
11:18.750 --> 11:21.320
and even erase memories.

129
11:21.910 --> 11:22.620
Why else do you think

130
11:22.620 --> 11:24.750
Ning Changyue wanted to learn from me?

131
11:26.510 --> 11:27.150
Then...

132
11:28.790 --> 11:29.600
Well...

133
11:30.270 --> 11:31.510
When did that happen?

134
11:32.950 --> 11:33.920
Let me think.

135
11:40.000 --> 11:41.000
I don't remember.

136
11:41.440 --> 11:42.270
Anyway.

137
11:43.240 --> 11:45.390
He learned it because of you.

138
11:47.510 --> 11:48.630
Because of me?

139
11:52.670 --> 11:54.790
Did you learn from Yu Tu because of me?

140
12:08.360 --> 12:09.840
Actually, I just wanted to

141
12:11.510 --> 12:13.440
solve these problems thoroughly.

142
12:15.120 --> 12:17.030
Maybe then you wouldn't be angry.

143
12:29.870 --> 12:30.730
Ning Changyue.

144
12:34.000 --> 12:34.870
Do you dare

145
12:39.320 --> 12:40.920
to fall in love with me again?

146
12:42.800 --> 12:46.350
♪ You are my light, my reason why ♪

147
12:46.550 --> 12:50.110
♪ You shine upon the depths inside ♪

148
12:50.400 --> 12:51.930
♪ Because of you ♪

149
12:51.970 --> 12:55.390
♪ I finally learned ♪

150
12:55.520 --> 12:56.860
♪ To keep moving forward ♪

151
13:04.440 --> 13:05.720
Hello, everyone.

152
13:06.040 --> 13:07.790
I moved a while ago, remember?

153
13:07.820 --> 13:10.820
Guess what I found in the old house.

154
13:10.840 --> 13:13.470
Miss Song, what are you doing?

155
13:13.840 --> 13:16.200
My grandmother's hidden treasure.

156
13:18.190 --> 13:18.920
Song Yiqiu,

157
13:19.460 --> 13:20.240
what are you doing?

158
13:20.240 --> 13:21.870
A Republic of China-era marriage certificate.

159
13:21.870 --> 13:23.630
You probably won't find

160
13:23.650 --> 13:25.780
another one online in this condition.

161
13:26.240 --> 13:26.750
Come on,

162
13:27.240 --> 13:29.300
let's take a look at the format first.

163
13:30.120 --> 13:31.980
Two families joined in marriage.

164
13:32.240 --> 13:33.550
Bound together in matrimony.

165
13:33.550 --> 13:35.210
Bound together in matrimony.

166
13:36.910 --> 13:38.870
This opening is very classic.

167
13:39.270 --> 13:41.200
Let's continue reading.

168
13:41.400 --> 13:42.130
Let me see.

169
13:43.030 --> 13:45.630
Today, with these words written in red,

170
13:46.070 --> 13:48.000
our fates are bound by the red cord.

171
13:48.870 --> 13:50.850
I, Huai, sincerely

172
13:51.080 --> 13:53.030
forge an eternal bond with you.

173
13:53.030 --> 13:54.760
Forge an eternal bond with you.

174
13:59.320 --> 14:01.320
I'll open it for everyone to see now.

175
14:03.000 --> 14:05.320
May we know each other through every season,

176
14:05.320 --> 14:06.910
in warmth and cold alike.

177
14:07.240 --> 14:08.720
May we share in all the joys

178
14:09.150 --> 14:10.630
that life has to offer.

179
14:11.520 --> 14:13.380
Let the sun and moon bear witness,

180
14:13.510 --> 14:15.370
and heaven and earth be our testament.

181
14:15.370 --> 14:16.770
If I betray your heart,

182
14:16.910 --> 14:18.240
I betray heaven itself.

183
14:18.840 --> 14:20.550
My heart shall never waver,

184
14:21.040 --> 14:22.640
nor shall I ever forsake you.

185
14:28.910 --> 14:30.080
Lin Huai.

186
14:30.720 --> 14:31.520
Baiwei,

187
14:33.150 --> 14:34.360
please marry me.

188
14:36.120 --> 14:37.360
Sworn by,

189
14:38.630 --> 14:39.720
Lin Huai.

190
14:41.080 --> 14:42.240
Song Baiwei.

191
14:47.440 --> 14:48.670
Song Baiwei.

192
14:50.140 --> 14:51.690
Song Yiqiu.

193
14:56.410 --> 14:57.410
Is it you?

194
15:00.130 --> 15:01.450
Is it really you?

195
15:12.110 --> 15:15.070
♪ Longing flows on like water ♪

196
15:16.220 --> 15:19.210
♪ Through the turning nights and days ♪

197
15:20.030 --> 15:22.440
♪ I gaze upon your light ♪

198
15:22.470 --> 15:26.320
♪ And stay here, watching over you ♪

199
15:27.620 --> 15:30.650
♪ Longing carries through the years ♪

200
15:31.680 --> 15:34.400
♪ As fate turns back around ♪

201
15:35.430 --> 15:38.200
♪ If I could grow old with you ♪

202
15:38.220 --> 15:43.500
♪ This life would be enough ♪

203
16:04.710 --> 16:05.440
Where is he?

204
16:07.080 --> 16:08.410
Where is Ning Changyue?

205
16:09.240 --> 16:09.870
He...

206
16:10.320 --> 16:11.200
I don't know.

207
16:12.320 --> 16:14.180
Was it because things got awkward

208
16:14.550 --> 16:16.080
between you two yesterday?

209
16:20.220 --> 16:21.310
Go do your thing.

210
16:30.790 --> 16:31.480
Look,

211
16:33.110 --> 16:35.910
how did two more flowers appear overnight?

212
16:37.880 --> 16:38.640
Let me see.

213
16:43.800 --> 16:45.470
Could it be that once the flowers bloom,

214
16:45.470 --> 16:47.990
the Vow to Live Forever will be broken?

215
16:48.310 --> 16:50.020
What if you two suddenly

216
16:50.150 --> 16:52.030
grow old and lose your looks,

217
16:52.450 --> 16:55.740
while I'm the only one who stays young and beautiful?

218
16:58.550 --> 17:00.080
Could it be that the shows you've been watching lately

219
17:00.080 --> 17:02.340
are all about these manipulative girls?

220
17:03.470 --> 17:04.319
Yeah.

221
17:04.400 --> 17:05.349
My show,

222
17:05.349 --> 17:08.069
"The Manipulative Beauty Tames the Crazy Prince",

223
17:08.069 --> 17:08.920
has updated.

224
17:09.040 --> 17:10.170
Then I'll get going.

225
17:11.510 --> 17:12.710
Time to watch my show.

226
17:21.099 --> 17:22.490
It seems this time,

227
17:22.960 --> 17:25.160
the eternal life is really going to end.

228
17:32.240 --> 17:33.310
Mr. Painting,

229
17:34.400 --> 17:35.790
or Mrs. Painting,

230
17:36.470 --> 17:39.120
can I ask you a favor?

231
17:39.140 --> 17:41.260
Regarding the frequency of this blooming,

232
17:41.260 --> 17:43.010
can we control it to

233
17:43.680 --> 17:44.830
once a week...

234
17:45.120 --> 17:45.830
No, no, no.

235
17:46.310 --> 17:47.910
Once a month.

236
17:48.310 --> 17:49.440
One flower at a time,

237
17:49.720 --> 17:50.270
okay?

238
17:50.780 --> 17:52.350
We need to take a scientific approach

239
17:52.350 --> 17:53.720
to flowering.

240
17:53.870 --> 17:55.220
Slow and steady.

241
17:55.350 --> 17:57.160
Quality

242
17:57.720 --> 17:58.790
over quantity.

243
17:59.510 --> 18:00.170
Sound good?

244
18:00.680 --> 18:01.440
Is it okay?

245
18:01.640 --> 18:03.440
Please, please, please.

246
18:04.030 --> 18:06.090
Please, just slow down the blooming.

247
18:14.640 --> 18:15.070
You...

248
18:15.680 --> 18:16.720
You, you, you...

249
18:17.080 --> 18:20.120
I tried to reason with you nicely, but you wouldn't listen, would you?

250
18:20.120 --> 18:21.520
You're driving me crazy.

251
18:25.320 --> 18:27.670
That's fine.

252
18:33.480 --> 18:35.880
I'll bring you out when you've calmed down.

253
18:38.100 --> 18:38.960
Ning Changyue.

254
18:52.930 --> 18:53.850
Lin Huai.
